&lt;p&gt;🚀 Hacktoberfest Week 3 Challenge: AI Study Planner&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Hello everyone! 👋&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I'm excited to share my project for the Hacktoberfest Week 3 Challenge!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;📚 About My Project&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I built an AI Study Planner to help students organize their studies and create personalized study plans. This project helped me explore AI integration and web application development.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;✨ Features&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📅 Create personalized study plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤖 AI-powered study planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎯 Organize learning goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💻 Simple and user-friendly interface&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;🛠️ Technologies Used&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
